    "created_at": "2017-12-18T14:46:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-12-18T14:46:56Z",
    "body": "I think CSSOM View still needs a fix for https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=25722 / https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2464 for this change to make a difference.\r\n\r\nI see these tests for noopener, but I think the tests we have don't check for \"tab\" vs \"window\".\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/html/browsers/the-window-object/window-open-noopener.html\r\nhttps://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/html/browsers/the-window-object/apis-for-creating-and-navigating-browsing-contexts-by-name/open-features-tokenization-noopener.html",
